msgctxt "94\t133"
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "134\t244"
msgid ""
"Oh, Date-san.\\n"
"Not drinking alone tonight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "245\t305"
msgid "Not tonight, Mama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556\t642"
msgid "Date-san, this is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "643\t752"
msgid "Yup, Serena's finally back in business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "753\t859"
msgid "New mama's really spruced the place up, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860\t932"
msgid "Date-san. Will you be having the usual?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "933\t1058"
msgid ""
"Sure. And the kid'll be in soon,\\n"
"so fix one up for him, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156\t1229"
msgid "She's pretty young to be owning a bar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1230\t1290"
msgid "You're telling me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304\t1403"
msgid ""
"But she's got the guts\\n"
"of a much older woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1404\t1487"
msgid "Who are you calling old?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1488\t1548"
msgid "Your drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1558\t1630"
msgid "Didn't mean for you to hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1631\t1740"
msgid ""
"Mama, you mind stepping out for a bit?\\n"
"My friend and I have some catching up to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1741\t1824"
msgid "Of course, take all the time you need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2111\t2291"
msgid ""
"This place is practically a second home by now.\\n"
"No chance we'll get found here, don't worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2292\t2341"
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2342\t2480"
msgid ""
"But Date-san...\\n"
"How'd you know where I'd be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2481\t2533"
msgid "Kazuki filled me in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2534\t2679"
msgid ""
"With your track record, I knew it wouldn't be long\\n"
"'til you were the center of another mess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2754\t2803"
msgid "About time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2804\t2845"
msgid "You got the stuff?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2846\t2995"
msgid ""
"Don't say it like that.\\n"
"You make this sound like some kinda drug deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2996\t3050"
msgid "Here, your drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3099\t3204"
msgid ""
"This stuff's pure alcohol!\\n"
"You trying to poison me, Mama?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3205\t3247"
msgid "Splash some water in there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3248\t3308"
msgid "Coming right up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3432\t3519"
msgid "There it is. Nice work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3618\t3678"
msgid "Don't pretend you're my boss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3679\t3873"
msgid ""
"Look at me, taking orders from the new guy.\\n"
"I'm a freaking senior editor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3910\t3967"
msgid "And those are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3968\t4117"
msgid "Oh. Just a few things for you to look at."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4132\t4231"
msgid "These are the five current Tojo Clan officers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4343\t4403"
msgid "What are you getting at?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4489\t4600"
msgid "Truth of it is, my title's changed a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4679\t4802"
msgid "Date-san... You're working for a paper?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4811\t4869"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4870\t4978"
msgid "Kiryu. This garbage you're dealing with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4979\t5075"
msgid "It all ties back to a story I'm chasing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5080\t5133"
msgid "What story?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5134\t5334"
msgid ""
"The link between the Tojo Clan and\\n"
"the Okinawa resort Minister Suzuki's so keen on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5375\t5461"
msgid "This fire's getting hot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5462\t5616"
msgid ""
"Let's take some time and go over the key players.\\n"
"Don't want you getting burned."
msgstr ""